This licence covers the library's own code and files (include/, src/, tools/, mk/, tests/, the shaders shaders/plain.slang,
shaders/ui.slang and the descriptors shaders/own/*.slangp). It does not cover:
  - third_party/glslang: glslang 15.1.0, under its own licences (third_party/glslang/LICENSE.txt);
  - third_party/stb: stb_image 2.30, public domain or MIT (third_party/stb/LICENSE);
  - shaders/slang: files of libretro/slang-shaders, each under the licence it states (most of them GPL), data that
    is never compiled into a program unless every file of the preset is public domain, Unlicense, CC0 or MIT
    (tools/shader_licences.py --check), and otherwise ships as separate files (README.md, "Shaders");
  - shaders/licences: the GNU GPL's texts, shipped with those files.
